<title>SOUTH AFRICA: New Elandsrand, Deelkraal cautionary.</title>
<headline>New Elandsrand, Deelkraal cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African gold mines Elandsrand Gold Mining Co Ltd and Deelkraal Gold Mining Co Ltd said on Friday that shareholders should exercise caution in the absence of further developments since the two said on August 23 they were studying a tie-up.</p>
<p>The neighbouring mines said at that time that the target was realising benefits which could be achieved through joint action.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
